        / data format of field: 8-byte DOUBLE            TUNIT1  = 's       '           / physical unit of field                         TTYPE2  = 'STOP    '           / GTI stop  time                                 TFORM2  = 'D       '           / data format of field: 8-byte DOUBLE            TUNIT2  = 's       '           / physical unit of field                         EXTNAME = 'STDGTI  '           / name of this binary table extension            HDUCLASS= 'OGIP    '           / Conforms to OGIP/GSFC standards                HDUCLAS1= 'GTI     '           / Contains good time intervals                   HDUCLAS2= 'STANDARD'           / Contains standard good time intervals          HDUVERS = '1.0.0   '           / Version of GTI header                          TIMEZERO=                   0. / Zero-point offset for TIME column              MJDREF  = 5.500000000000000E+04 / MJD Epoch of TIME = 0                         TSTART  =                   0. / Start time of GTI                              TSTOP   =               10000. / Stop  time of GTI                              INSTRUME= 'TM1     '                                                            TELESCOP= 'eROSITA '                                                            END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    